EVTDESCPIRATE20;We have had reports that a great misfortune has befallen to your [From.GetRootRelation] [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty]. [From.GetSheHeCap] had been sailing the seas near [From.Location.GetName] when they were attacked by a flotilla of pirates! [From.GetTitledFirstName] and the crew are now reportedly in the captivity of [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName].;Nous avons re�u de mauvaises nouvelles concernant votre [From.GetRootRelation] [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty]. [From.GetSheHeCap] naviguait pr�s de [From.Location.GetName] lorsque son navire a �t� attaqu� par une flotille pirate ! [From.GetTitledFirstName] et son �quipage sont aux mains de [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName].;;;Hemos recibido malas noticias concernientes a tu [From.GetRootRelation] [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty]. �[From.GetSheHeCap] navegaba cerca de [From.Location.GetName] cuando fue atacado por una flota pirata! [From.GetTitledFirstName] y su tripulaci�n son ahora prisioneros de [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName].;;;;;;;;;x
