TOOLTIPanti_piracySUCCESS;[This.GetFirstNameWithDynasty]'s fleets are scuppered and [This.GetHerHis] harbours destroyed.\nAll women kidnapped, slaves captured and swords stolen from the subjects of [Root.GetTitle] [Root.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] by [This.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] and [This.GetHerHis] fellow his pirates shall be returned, along with a sum of gold in recompense.\n[This.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] will be unable to proclaim [This.GetHerselfHimself] a Pirate [This.GetKingQueen] for 5 years.\n;La flotte de [This.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] est an�antie et ses ports d�truits.\nToutes les femmes kidnapp�es, les esclaves captur�s et les lames vol�es aux sujets de [Root.GetTitle] [Root.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] par [This.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] et ses pirates vont revenir, ainsi qu'une forte somme d'argent.\n;;;La flota de [This.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] ha sido hundida y sus puertos arrasados.\nTodas las mujeres secuestradas, los esclavos capturados y las espadas robadas a [Root.GetTitle] [Root.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] por [This.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] y sus compa�eros piratas deben ser recuperadas, aqu�l que lasrecupere recibir� una suma de oro como recompensa\n;;;;;;;;;x
